tics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certification eligibility should always be checked against the current requirements of the issuing organization."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students wanting to progress beyond technical emergency-care roles can consider postgraduate study in areas such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical/Healthcare"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Critical Care Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Emergency & Critical Care"},{"text":"M.Sc. Medical Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Emergency Medicine-related disciplines, where eligible"},{"text":"M.Sc. Clinical Research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Healthcare Management"},{"text":"MBA Hospital Administration"},{"text":"Master of Public Health (MPH)"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Health Informatics"},{"text":"Healthcare Data Analytics"},{"text":"Biomedical Technology"},{"text":"Digital Health"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"With experience and further education, possible specialization areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"🚑 Emergency & Trauma"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trauma-care technology"},{"text":"Emergency department operations"},{"text":"Accident and emergency care"}]},{"type":"h","text":"❤️ Cardiac Emergency Care"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiac monitoring"},{"text":"Emergency cardiac support"},{"text":"Critical cardiac-care environments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"🫁 Respiratory & Critical Care"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ventilator technology"},{"text":"Respiratory monitoring"},{"text":"ICU technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"🧠 Neurological Emergency Care"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stroke-care environments"},{"text":"Neurocritical-care support"},{"text":"Neurological monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"🏥 Healthcare Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient-monitoring systems"},{"tex