onitoring systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should aim for:"},{"type":"p","text":"Emergency Care"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Critical Care"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Patient Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"ECG Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Trauma Care"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Resuscitation Training"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Medical Equipment"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Infection Control"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Healthcare IT"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI & Digital Health Awareness"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate profile would demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solid anatomy and physiology knowledge"},{"text":"Strong emergency-care fundamentals"},{"text":"Critical-care understanding"},{"text":"Patient-monitoring competency"},{"text":"ECG fundamentals"},{"text":"Trauma-care exposure"},{"text":"Resuscitation certification/training"},{"text":"Hospital clinical internship"},{"text":"Medical-equipment familiarity"},{"text":"Infection-control knowledge"},{"text":"Strong documentation skills"},{"text":"Effective emergency-team communication"},{"text":"Basic healthcare IT knowledge"},{"text":"Awareness of AI-enabled healthcare"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of a conventional software portfolio, build a Clinical Competency Portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical internship record"},{"text":"Emergency-care certifications"},{"text":"BLS/CPR credentials"},{"text":"Case-study presentations"},{"text":"Emergency-care 